    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65089" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαρτύριον</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ], τό</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>testimony, proof</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρῶτον καὶ μέγιστον μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.22
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>I.</u>
				4(3).10
			</span></i>, etc.: freq. in pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαρτύρια θέσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.55
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1095
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Eu.</u>
				485
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				797
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετ᾽ ἀειμνήστου μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.33
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαρτύριον δέ</span> . . , folld.
			by <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάρ</span>, <i>here is a proof,
			namely</i> . . , ib.<i><span class="en">
				8
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέγα τόδε μ., . . γάρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.120
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ μ.</span>
